"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Language: zh_Hans\n"

msgid "ZTE Mesh"
msgstr "中兴组网"

msgid "Manage ZTE child routers over the wired LAN. This router acts as the mesh controller; the child routers receive the Wi-Fi profile below."
msgstr "通过有线局域网管理中兴子路由器。本路由器作为组网主控,子路由器会收到下方的 Wi-Fi 配置。"

msgid "The ZTE Mesh runtime is not installed on this router."
msgstr "本路由器尚未安装中兴组网运行环境。"

msgid "Controller"
msgstr "主控"

msgid "Running"
msgstr "运行中"

msgid "Starting or stalled"
msgstr "正在启动或已停滞"

msgid "Stopped"
msgstr "已停止"

msgid "Controller address (AL MAC)"
msgstr "主控地址 (AL MAC)"

msgid "Network mode"
msgstr "组网模式"

msgid "ZTE enhanced"
msgstr "中兴增强互通"

msgid "ZTE compatible"
msgstr "中兴兼容旧版"

msgid "Standard Multi-AP"
msgstr "标准 Multi-AP"

msgid "Wired port"
msgstr "有线端口"

msgid "Attached to the LAN bridge"
msgstr "已接入 LAN 桥"

msgid "Not attached"
msgstr "未接入"

msgid "Wi-Fi updates sent"
msgstr "已下发 Wi-Fi 配置次数"

msgid "Last configuration problem"
msgstr "最近的配置问题"

msgid "Pending"
msgstr "待处理"

msgid "The network mode changed; restart the controller to apply it."
msgstr "组网模式已更改,请重启主控使其生效。"

msgid "Report"
msgstr "状态报告"

msgid "No fresh status for %d s"
msgstr "已 %d 秒没有新的状态"

msgid "Name"
msgstr "名称"

msgid "Model"
msgstr "型号"

msgid "Address"
msgstr "地址"

msgid "MAC"
msgstr "MAC"

msgid "Software"
msgstr "软件版本"

msgid "Type"
msgstr "类型"

msgid "State"
msgstr "状态"

msgid "Standard"
msgstr "标准"

msgid "Online"
msgstr "在线"

msgid "Offline"
msgstr "离线"

msgid "No child routers have been discovered yet."
msgstr "尚未发现任何子路由器。"

msgid "General"
msgstr "常规"

msgid "Wi-Fi profile"
msgstr "Wi-Fi 配置"

msgid "Enable"
msgstr "启用"

msgid "Standard Multi-AP (tested)"
msgstr "标准 Multi-AP(已测试)"

msgid "ZTE enhanced (experimental)"
msgstr "中兴增强互通(实验性)"

msgid "ZTE compatible with older routers (experimental)"
msgstr "中兴兼容旧版路由器(实验性)"

msgid "Standard mode speaks plain IEEE 1905 / Multi-AP and omits the ZTE vendor extensions."
msgstr "标准模式只使用 IEEE 1905 / Multi-AP,不发送中兴私有扩展。"

msgid "LAN bridge"
msgstr "LAN 桥"

msgid "%s enabled"
msgstr "启用 %s"

msgid "%s network name (SSID)"
msgstr "%s 网络名称 (SSID)"

msgid "%s password"
msgstr "%s 密码"

msgid "2.4 GHz"
msgstr "2.4 GHz"

msgid "5 GHz"
msgstr "5 GHz"

msgid "Restart controller"
msgstr "重启主控"

msgid "The controller is restarting."
msgstr "主控正在重启。"

msgid "Status"
msgstr "状态"

msgid "Child routers"
msgstr "子路由器"

msgid "Roaming and steering"
msgstr "漫游与频段引导"

msgid "Device role"
msgstr "设备角色"

msgid "Default (master)"
msgstr "默认(主路由)"

msgid "Main router"
msgstr "主路由"

msgid "Adaptive"
msgstr "自适应"

msgid "The factory \"main router / adaptive\" switch. Only the controller role is supported. Changing from main router to adaptive restarts the mesh daemon twice and the child routers drop out of the topology for a short while; adding or removing this option restarts the service."
msgstr "原厂的\"主路由 / 自适应\"开关。只支持主控角色。从主路由改为自适应会让组网守护进程重启两次,子路由器会短暂掉出拓扑;添加或删除此选项会重启服务。"

msgid "Self-organizing network V2"
msgstr "自组网 V2"

msgid "Strictly check that neighbours are ZTE devices with the same market code. Switching restarts the mesh daemon (the child routers drop out of the topology for up to a minute)."
msgstr "严格检查邻居是否为市场码相同的中兴设备。切换会重启组网守护进程(子路由器最多一分钟内掉出拓扑)。"

msgid "Wi-Fi 7 MLO"
msgstr "Wi-Fi 7 MLO"

msgid "Tell child routers whether multi-link operation is on. Only Wi-Fi 7 children act on it."
msgstr "告诉子路由器是否开启多链路操作。只有 Wi-Fi 7 子路由器会响应。"

msgid "Same name and password on both bands"
msgstr "双频使用相同的名称和密码"

msgid "On: the 5 GHz band uses the 2.4 GHz name and password. Off: the 5 GHz name is the 2.4 GHz name plus the suffix below unless a 5 GHz name is given."
msgstr "开:5 GHz 使用 2.4 GHz 的名称和密码。关:除非单独填了 5 GHz 名称,否则 5 GHz 名称 = 2.4 GHz 名称 + 下方的后缀。"

msgid "Off switches the main network of this band off on the child routers."
msgstr "关闭会让子路由器上这个频段的主网络关闭。"

msgid "2.4 GHz name + suffix"
msgstr "2.4 GHz 名称 + 后缀"

msgid "Same as 2.4 GHz"
msgstr "与 2.4 GHz 相同"

msgid "5 GHz name suffix"
msgstr "5 GHz 名称后缀"

msgid "Appended to the 2.4 GHz name when no 5 GHz name is given (factory default -5G)."
msgstr "没有填 5 GHz 名称时附加在 2.4 GHz 名称后面(原厂默认 -5G)。"

msgid "%s hidden network name"
msgstr "%s 隐藏网络名称"

msgid "%s security"
msgstr "%s 加密方式"

msgid "Default (WPA2)"
msgstr "默认(WPA2)"

msgid "None (open network)"
msgstr "无(开放网络)"

msgid "Child routers without WPA3 treat WPA2/WPA3 as WPA2 and ignore WPA3-only. \"None\" makes the main network open."
msgstr "不支持 WPA3 的子路由器会把 WPA2/WPA3 当作 WPA2,并忽略仅 WPA3。\"无\"会让主网络变成开放网络。"

msgid "%s beacon interval (ms)"
msgstr "%s 信标间隔(毫秒)"

msgid "%s channel"
msgstr "%s 信道"

msgid "Leave empty to keep the child routers' setting; 0 = automatic"
msgstr "留空 = 保持子路由器现有设置;0 = 自动"

msgid "%s transmit power (dBm, EIRP)"
msgstr "%s 发射功率(dBm,EIRP)"

msgid "%s MAC filter policy"
msgstr "%s MAC 过滤策略"

msgid "Keep the child routers' setting"
msgstr "保持子路由器现有设置"

msgid "Off"
msgstr "关闭"

msgid "Block listed devices"
msgstr "禁止列表中的设备"

msgid "Allow only listed devices"
msgstr "只允许列表中的设备"

msgid "Band steering"
msgstr "频段引导"

msgid "Move capable devices to the better band. The factory turns this off together with the dual-band switch; here it is a separate choice."
msgstr "把支持的设备引导到更合适的频段。原厂在关闭双频合一时会一并关掉它;这里是单独的选项。"

msgid "Band steering threshold, 2.4 GHz (dBm)"
msgstr "频段引导阈值,2.4 GHz(dBm)"

msgid "Both thresholds must be set together."
msgstr "两个阈值必须同时设置。"

msgid "Band steering threshold, 5 GHz (dBm)"
msgstr "频段引导阈值,5 GHz(dBm)"

msgid "Roaming threshold, 2.4 GHz (dBm)"
msgstr "漫游阈值,2.4 GHz(dBm)"

msgid "Both thresholds must be set together. The values are sent to the child routers; some models ignore them."
msgstr "两个阈值必须同时设置。数值会发给子路由器,部分型号会忽略。"

msgid "Roaming threshold, 5 GHz (dBm)"
msgstr "漫游阈值,5 GHz(dBm)"

msgid "Force roaming on weak signal"
msgstr "弱信号强制切换"

msgid "Extra Wi-Fi networks"
msgstr "额外的 Wi-Fi 网络"

msgid "Guest, spare and hidden backhaul networks of the child routers. The slots of one band must be 1, 2, 3 in order without a gap: removing slot 1 while slot 2 exists is refused. Adding or removing a slot makes the child routers drop out of the topology for up to a minute; switching one on or off does not."
msgstr "子路由器的访客、备用和隐藏回程网络。同一频段的槽位必须按 1、2、3 连续,不能有空档:槽位 2 还在时去掉槽位 1 会被拒绝。增加或去掉槽位会让子路由器最多一分钟内掉出拓扑;开关一个槽位不会。"

msgid "Band"
msgstr "频段"

msgid "Slot"
msgstr "槽位"

msgid "1 (guest)"
msgstr "1(访客)"

msgid "2 (spare)"
msgstr "2(备用)"

msgid "3 (hidden backhaul)"
msgstr "3(隐藏回程)"

msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "启用"

msgid "Network name (SSID)"
msgstr "网络名称 (SSID)"

msgid "Password"
msgstr "密码"

msgid "Hidden network name"
msgstr "隐藏网络名称"

msgid "Security"
msgstr "加密方式"

msgid "MAC filter policy"
msgstr "MAC 过滤策略"

msgid "MAC filter list"
msgstr "MAC 过滤列表"

msgid "Up to 16 devices. A rule applies to the main network of the chosen band or to one of its extra networks; the policy above decides whether listed devices are blocked or the only ones allowed."
msgstr "最多 16 台设备。一条规则作用于所选频段的主网络或其某个额外网络;上方的策略决定列表中的设备是被禁止还是唯一被允许。"

msgid "MAC address"
msgstr "MAC 地址"

msgid "Both"
msgstr "两个频段"

msgid "Network"
msgstr "网络"

msgid "Main network"
msgstr "主网络"

msgid "Extra network 1"
msgstr "额外网络 1"

msgid "Extra network 2"
msgstr "额外网络 2"

msgid "Extra network 3"
msgstr "额外网络 3"

msgid "Only letters, digits and _ . - are allowed"
msgstr "只能使用字母、数字和 _ . -"

msgid "No answer from the controller yet."
msgstr "主控还没有回应。"

msgid "The request was malformed."
msgstr "请求格式不正确。"

msgid "That router is not online or is not a ZTE router."
msgstr "该路由器不在线,或不是中兴路由器。"

msgid "The controller is restarting; try again in a moment."
msgstr "主控正在重启,请稍后再试。"

msgid "The controller is not running."
msgstr "主控没有运行。"

msgid "The controller could not send the request (%s)."
msgstr "主控没能发出请求(%s)。"

msgid "Actions"
msgstr "操作"

msgid "Indicator light switched on."
msgstr "指示灯已打开。"

msgid "Indicator light switched off."
msgstr "指示灯已关闭。"

msgid "Restart router"
msgstr "重启路由器"

msgid "Restart %s? Its Wi-Fi and the devices connected through it are offline for a few minutes."
msgstr "重启 %s?它的 Wi-Fi 和通过它上网的设备会离线几分钟。"

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "取消"

msgid "Restart"
msgstr "重启"

msgid "The restart request was sent."
msgstr "重启请求已发出。"

msgid "Light on"
msgstr "开灯"

msgid "Light off"
msgstr "关灯"

msgid "Switch off after (minutes)"
msgstr "多少分钟后关闭"

msgid "Guest time limit: the network is switched off this long after it came on. Switching it off and on again, or changing this value, restarts the countdown. Not kept across a controller restart."
msgstr "访客限时:网络开启后经过这么久会被关闭。把它关掉再打开,或改动这个值,会重新计时。主控重启后不保留。"

msgid "Wi-Fi 5 compatible network"
msgstr "Wi-Fi 5 兼容网络"

msgid "Announces the network as Wi-Fi 5 only to child routers that understand it; many models ignore it."
msgstr "只对看得懂的子路由器声明该网络为 Wi-Fi 5;很多型号会忽略。"

msgid "Wi-Fi schedule"
msgstr "Wi-Fi 定时关闭"

msgid "Switch Wi-Fi off during these windows on every child router. \"All Wi-Fi\" turns off the main networks and the guest and spare networks (the hidden backhaul network stays on); \"Guest network\" turns off guest network 1 only. A window that ends before it starts runs past midnight. Times are in the router's time zone (the zone in effect when the settings were saved)."
msgstr "在这些时间段内关闭每台子路由器的 Wi-Fi。\"全部 Wi-Fi\"关闭主网络以及访客、备用网络(隐藏的回程网络保持开启);\"访客网络\"只关闭访客网络 1。结束时间早于开始时间表示跨过午夜。时间按路由器的时区计(保存设置时生效的时区)。"

msgid "Use the form HH:MM, for example 23:00"
msgstr "请用 HH:MM 的格式,例如 23:00"

msgid "Off from"
msgstr "关闭时间"

msgid "Back on at"
msgstr "恢复时间"

msgid "On the days that start on"
msgstr "适用的星期(按开始当天算)"

msgid "Mon"
msgstr "周一"

msgid "Tue"
msgstr "周二"

msgid "Wed"
msgstr "周三"

msgid "Thu"
msgstr "周四"

msgid "Fri"
msgstr "周五"

msgid "Sat"
msgstr "周六"

msgid "Sun"
msgstr "周日"

msgid "Switch off"
msgstr "关闭范围"

msgid "All Wi-Fi"
msgstr "全部 Wi-Fi"

msgid "Guest network"
msgstr "访客网络"

msgid "Light"
msgstr "指示灯"

msgid "Clients"
msgstr "终端数"

msgid "On"
msgstr "开"

msgid "Router names"
msgstr "路由器名称"

msgid "Names for child routers, shown in the list above instead of the name the router reports. They are kept on this router only; the child routers keep their own names."
msgstr "给子路由器起的名称,显示在上面的列表里,代替路由器自己报的名称。只保存在本路由器上,子路由器保留自己的名称。"
